---
title: "transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization (Shared across sale types)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_verify_sig: verify cryptographic authorization from Legion signer
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid authorization signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidAuthorization
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_target: valid authorization
    q_check_target --> q_check_existing: target address valid
    q_check_target --> q_revert_target: invalid target
    q_revert_target --> [*]: revert InvalidTarget
    q_check_existing --> q_transfer_pos: target has no existing position
    q_check_existing --> q_revert_existing: target already has position
    q_revert_existing --> [*]: revert TargetHasPosition
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_source: copy position from source to target
    q_clear_source --> [*]: clear source position, emit PositionTransferred

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: cryptographic authorization from Legion signer required
        INV-002: authorization includes source, target, nonce to prevent replay
        INV-003: position transfer is atomic (all-or-nothing)
    end note
